1
00:00:03,218 --> 00:00:06,830
The toolbar shows the name of the workflow, with a link back to

2
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:09,918
Workflows, and the Publish and Discard draft buttons.

3
00:00:10,374 --> 00:00:15,623
The Activities pane on the left lists everything you can add, grouped by category.

4
00:00:15,623 --> 00:00:18,844
Search it by name, or show only Events or Tasks.

5
00:00:19,336 --> 00:00:23,303
The canvas in the middle is where the workflow takes shape.

6
00:00:23,303 --> 00:00:28,796
A workflow runs when something happens, so an empty one offers events to start with.

7
00:00:29,255 --> 00:00:32,529
On the right, the workflow panel has three tabs.

8
00:00:32,529 --> 00:00:37,865
Variables holds named values, Workflow holds settings such as the name, and Issues

9
00:00:37,865 --> 00:00:39,745
lists the problems found.

